# =============================================================================
#  Opt-in repository root -- ignore EVERYTHING here, then re-include only the
#  paths the cloud bot actually needs.
#
#  Why opt-in: this folder is also a local working directory (scratch runs,
#  logs, editor/tool state).  A denylist would leak that content into the
#  repository; an allowlist cannot.
#
#  cryptobot/ is re-included as a whole, so cryptobot/.gitignore stays in force
#  for the runtime state INSIDE the package (data/ledger.sqlite, logs/*.jsonl,
#  run/ scratch, __pycache__, ...).
# =============================================================================
/*

# --- the only paths that get committed ---------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/DEPLOY.md
!/cryptobot/
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/.gitattributes
